{"abstract": "This repository contains the experimental data supporting the manuscript characterizing the nonlinear dynamics of a passive silicon photonic structure composed of three Side-Coupled-Integrated-Spaced-Sequence of Resonators (SCISSOR). The SCISSOR platform supports intrinsic spiking dynamics and is deployed as a photonic core for time-multiplexed analogue and digital neural networks. All data supporting the figures can be plotted using their associated python scripts.", "authors": ["Giovanni P. Donati"], "candidate_id": "ce092fd32303d2ddfac44b92", "decision": "summarize", "doi": "10.15129/03da6800-c038-4038-afc1-ded6006805b7", "landing_page": "https://doi.org/10.15129/03da6800-c038-4038-afc1-ded6006805b7", "mandatory": false, "matched_projects": ["optical-neural-networks"], "open_access_url": "https://doi.org/10.15129/03da6800-c038-4038-afc1-ded6006805b7", "openalex_id": "https://openalex.org/W7223068934", "schema_version": 1, "score": 0.76, "score_breakdown": [{"contribution": 0.32, "evidence": ["confirmed"], "feature": "project_confidence"}, {"contribution": 0.1, "evidence": ["Photonic neuromorphic", "neuromorphic"], "feature": "title_evidence"}, {"contribution": 0.04, "evidence": ["neural network", "silicon photonic"], "feature": "contextual_evidence"}, {"contribution": 0.08, "evidence": ["spiking"], "feature": "architecture_signal"}, {"contribution": 0.02, "evidence": ["University of Strathclyde", "general_unlisted"], "feature": "venue_prestige"}, {"contribution": 0.08, "evidence": ["abstract"], "feature": "metadata_abstract"}, {"contribution": 0.03, "evidence": ["10.15129/03da6800-c038-4038-afc1-ded6006805b7"], "feature": "metadata_doi"}, {"contribution": 0.02, "evidence": ["https://openalex.org/W7223068934"], "feature": "metadata_openalex_id"}, {"contribution": 0.02, "evidence": ["2026", "University of Strathclyde"], "feature": "metadata_venue_and_year"}, {"contribution": 0.05, "evidence": ["2_days"], "feature": "freshness"}], "selection_status": "